Elmer output file for SaveScalars, generated by a magnetostatics run.
 Data was saved by the SaveScalars solver fed from MagnetoDynamicsCalcFields (Calculate Nodal Forces).
Variables in columns of matrix: case.dat
  1: res: nodal force 1
  2: res: nodal force 2
  3: res: nodal force 3
  4: res: max: magnetic flux density
  5: time
